WEBVTT

00:16:27.917 --> 00:16:31.268
That mortal being incarnate in flesh

00:16:31.292 --> 00:16:35.000
shall not live, love or die alone.

00:16:36.708 --> 00:16:38.684
And if I could sing,

00:16:38.708 --> 00:16:41.976
if we could sing together,

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.934
my brothers and sisters,

00:16:43.958 --> 00:16:49.292
surely then we should never stop
the singing of this song.

00:16:50.542 --> 00:16:51.809
Thank you.

00:16:51.833 --> 00:16:56.042
(Applause)